  "body": "Forget the C.V. Focus on the opportunity - Enquiries Over $1,800,000\r\n\r\nWake up to the shimmer of the Orakei Basin, right from your window.\r\n\r\nThis front-line corner townhouse sits proudly on Ngaio Street, capturing views that most only get a glimpse of. Thoughtfully designed, it's the kind of home that feels effortless, light, modern, and surprisingly private.\r\n\r\nStep straight in from the street (no steps here) to sun-drenched, open living space that flow out to your own north-facing courtyard. It's calm, connected, and built for easy everyday living.\r\nEvery detail has been considered, from the Miele kitchen and warm natural palette to the clever layout that feels like true two-level living. Downstairs, a versatile bonus room offers space for a games room, gym, or media lounge, whatever suits your lifestyle.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, three generous bedrooms include a master with ensuite, complemented by a well-appointed main bathroom. Plus a flexi room at the bottom level can be a gym or entertainment room.\r\n\r\nAn internal-access double garage with an EV charger and plenty of storage provides space for all essentials. With the Hauraki Gulf so close by, quality schooling, public transport, and the waterfront route to Mission Bay and the CBD are all easily accessible.\r\n\r\nA Freehold title and 10-Year Stamford Building Insurance Warranty offer lasting confidence and peace of mind.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the best of both worlds, modern, low maintenance living in a peaceful, established pocket of Orakei. Just a short stroll to Orakei Bay Village for boutique shops, restaurants, and the cinema, or catch the train from Orakei Station for an easy city commute. The beaches, walkways, and coastal lifestyle of the Bays are all within easy reach.\r\nIt's the perfect balance: water views, city convenience, and a lifestyle that feels relaxed from the moment you step inside.\r\n\r\nWith interest rates easing and titles already issued, opportunities like this don't wait. Secure your place to begin living the Bays lifestyle, bright, breezy, and beautifully connected.\r\n\r\nViewing time has been scheduled or private viewing can be arranged with Kristy on 02041490233 .\r\n\r\nConjunctional are welcomed!\r\n\r\n*Images have been digitally staged",
